    {
      "id": "5b497792-18f2-4ac5-96bc-7fd68c1005d1",
      "name": "Why MCP is Awesome - Part 1",
      "path": "WWW / Blog / Why MCP is Awesome - Part 1",
      "docTypeId": "5d7bbc47-aeae-46b1-ad3f-214924e988b7",
      "templateId": "e0200430-1a30-46e7-aedb-8cff8c946e69",
      "state": "Published",
      "domains": [],
      "values": [
        {
          "editorAlias": "Umbraco.TextBox",
          "culture": null,
          "segment": null,
          "alias": "title",
          "value": "Why MCP is Awesome - Part 1"
        },
        {
          "editorAlias": "Umbraco.DateTime",
          "culture": null,
          "segment": null,
          "alias": "publishDate",
          "value": "2026-10-01 09:00:00"
        },
        {
          "editorAlias": "Umbraco.TextArea",
          "culture": null,
          "segment": null,
          "alias": "excerpt",
          "value": "MCP provides a standardized way for AI agents to interact with tools and resources."
        },
        {
          "editorAlias": "Umbraco.MediaPicker3",
          "culture": null,
          "segment": null,
          "alias": "listingImage",
          "value": [
            {
              "key": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-4789-a0b1-c2d3e4f5a6b7",
              "mediaKey": "23c031de-7452-4a62-a758-4d87c5907ef6",
              "mediaTypeAlias": "Image",
              "crops": [],
              "focalPoint": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "editorAlias": "Umbraco.BlockGrid",
          "culture": null,
          "segment": null,
          "alias": "body",
          "value": {
            "layout": {
              "Umbraco.BlockGrid": [
                {
                  "$type": "BlockGridLayoutItem",
                  "columnSpan": 12,
                  "rowSpan": 1,
                  "areas": [],
                  "contentKey": "557dbb3c-e2e5-4a49-b18f-efd6617b7f41",
                  "settingsKey": null
                },
                {
                  "$type": "BlockGridLayoutItem",
                  "columnSpan": 12,
                  "rowSpan": 1,
                  "areas": [],
                  "contentKey": "26c815f9-7135-4f12-83ad-96477405bd49",
                  "settingsKey": null
                },
                {
                  "$type": "BlockGridLayoutItem",
                  "columnSpan": 12,
                  "rowSpan": 1,
                  "areas": [],
                  "contentKey": "7a893ea8-7f13-4644-8d45-6f9ea2e7675a",
                  "settingsKey": null
                },
                {
                  "$type": "BlockGridLayoutItem",
                  "columnSpan": 12,
                  "rowSpan": 1,
                  "areas": [],
                  "contentKey": "8519795d-5bb4-46ab-bdd4-6f056ff70956",
                  "settingsKey": null
                }
              ]
            },
            "contentData": [
              {
                "contentTypeKey": "6aa38ff7-ac5a-46ca-842e-7a7d1a8fcc73",
                "key": "557dbb3c-e2e5-4a49-b18f-efd6617b7f41",
                "values": [
                  {
                    "editorAlias": "Umbraco.RichText",
                    "culture": null,
                    "segment": null,
                    "alias": "text",
                    "value": {
                      "markup": "<p>The Model Context Protocol (MCP) is a game-changer for AI agent development. It provides a standardized interface that allows AI models to discover, understand, and interact with tools and resources in a consistent way.</p><p>Before MCP, each AI application had to implement its own tooling infrastructure. This led to fragmentation and made it difficult to share tools between different agents.</p>",
                      "blocks": {
                        "layout": {},
                        "contentData": [],
                        "settingsData": [],
                        "expose": []
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "contentTypeKey": "266f46ef-a760-4a4a-b65c-b3b5d8f8a75e",
                "key": "26c815f9-7135-4f12-83ad-96477405bd49",
                "values": [
                  {
                    "editorAlias": "Umbraco.MediaPicker3",
                    "culture": null,
                    "segment": null,
                    "alias": "image",
                    "value": [
                      {
                        "key": "b2c3d4e5-f6a7-4890-b1c2-d3e4f5a6b7c8",
                        "mediaKey": "66b4273f-ec43-4ade-b0a5-89cb9f0946d7",
                        "mediaTypeAlias": "Image",
                        "crops": [],
                        "focalPoint": null
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "editorAlias": "Umbraco.TextBox",
                    "culture": null,
                    "segment": null,
                    "alias": "caption",
                    "value": "Code on screen - representing MCP's technical foundation"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "contentTypeKey": "6aa38ff7-ac5a-46ca-842e-7a7d1a8fcc73",
                "key": "7a893ea8-7f13-4644-8d45-6f9ea2e7675a",
                "values": [
                  {
                    "editorAlias": "Umbraco.RichText",
                    "culture": null,
                    "segment": null,
                    "alias": "text",
                    "value": {
                      "markup": "<p>With MCP, tools can be defined once and used by any compliant AI agent. This standardization reduces development time and increases reliability.</p><p>MCP servers expose capabilities through a well-defined schema, making it easy for agents to discover what tools are available and how to use them.</p>",
                      "blocks": {
                        "layout": {},
                        "contentData": [],
                        "settingsData": [],
                        "expose": []
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "contentTypeKey": "37e255e5-411b-499e-9299-6b2e354be1f0",
                "key": "8519795d-5bb4-46ab-bdd4-6f056ff70956",
                "values": [
                  {
                    "editorAlias": "Umbraco.TextArea",
                    "culture": null,
                    "segment": null,
                    "alias": "quote",
                    "value": "MCP is the foundation for the next generation of AI-powered applications."
                  },
                  {
                    "editorAlias": "Umbraco.TextBox",
                    "culture": null,
                    "segment": null,
                    "alias": "attribution",
                    "value": "AI Developer Community"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "settingsData": [],
            "expose": [
              {
                "contentKey": "557dbb3c-e2e5-4a49-b18f-efd6617b7f41",
                "culture": null,
                "segment": null
              },
              {
                "contentKey": "26c815f9-7135-4f12-83ad-96477405bd49",
                "culture": null,
                "segment": null
              },
