    {
      "id": "1426eb92-0efa-44f1-ad17-448a693b5854",
      "name": "Why MCP is Awesome - Part 2",
      "path": "WWW / Blog / Why MCP is Awesome - Part 2",
      "docTypeId": "5d7bbc47-aeae-46b1-ad3f-214924e988b7",
      "templateId": "e0200430-1a30-46e7-aedb-8cff8c946e69",
      "state": "Published",
      "domains": [],
      "values": [
        {
          "editorAlias": "Umbraco.TextBox",
          "culture": null,
          "segment": null,
          "alias": "title",
          "value": "Why MCP is Awesome - Part 2"
        },
        {
          "editorAlias": "Umbraco.DateTime",
          "culture": null,
          "segment": null,
          "alias": "publishDate",
          "value": "2026-10-02 09:00:00"
        },
        {
          "editorAlias": "Umbraco.TextArea",
          "culture": null,
          "segment": null,
          "alias": "excerpt",
          "value": "MCP enables seamless integration between AI agents and external systems."
        },
        {
          "editorAlias": "Umbraco.MediaPicker3",
          "culture": null,
          "segment": null,
          "alias": "listingImage",
          "value": [
            {
              "key": "c1d2e3f4-a5b6-4789-c0d1-e2f3a4b5c6d7",
              "mediaKey": "313873d7-29e8-4d80-90bf-43a7823436d2",
              "mediaTypeAlias": "Image",
              "crops": [],
              "focalPoint": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "editorAlias": "Umbraco.BlockGrid",
          "culture": null,
          "segment": null,
          "alias": "body",
          "value": {
            "layout": {
              "Umbraco.BlockGrid": [
                {
                  "$type": "BlockGridLayoutItem",
                  "columnSpan": 12,
                  "rowSpan": 1,
                  "areas": [],
                  "contentKey": "ab65a8d9-1817-42a9-811a-3c74df605940",
                  "settingsKey": null
                },
                {
                  "$type": "BlockGridLayoutItem",
                  "columnSpan": 12,
                  "rowSpan": 1,
                  "areas": [],
                  "contentKey": "b1dc6d35-5160-419d-ae11-93fb87a59533",
                  "settingsKey": null
                },
                {
                  "$type": "BlockGridLayoutItem",
                  "columnSpan": 12,
                  "rowSpan": 1,
                  "areas": [],
                  "contentKey": "2f8efb4a-4eae-4166-9cd2-926081dbe9a0",
                  "settingsKey": null
                },
                {
                  "$type": "BlockGridLayoutItem",
                  "columnSpan": 12,
                  "rowSpan": 1,
                  "areas": [],
                  "contentKey": "ee726006-f305-4fa2-b49f-b0759e9ba4d1",
                  "settingsKey": null
                }
              ]
            },
            "contentData": [
              {
                "contentTypeKey": "6aa38ff7-ac5a-46ca-842e-7a7d1a8fcc73",
                "key": "ab65a8d9-1817-42a9-811a-3c74df605940",
                "values": [
                  {
                    "editorAlias": "Umbraco.RichText",
                    "culture": null,
                    "segment": null,
                    "alias": "text",
                    "value": {
                      "markup": "<p>MCP doesn't just standardize tool interfaces - it also provides a framework for resource access. Resources in MCP can represent anything from static data to dynamic APIs.</p><p>This means AI agents can not only call functions but also read and write data through a consistent interface.</p>",
                      "blocks": {
                        "layout": {},
                        "contentData": [],
                        "settingsData": [],
                        "expose": []
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "contentTypeKey": "266f46ef-a760-4a4a-b65c-b3b5d8f8a75e",
                "key": "b1dc6d35-5160-419d-ae11-93fb87a59533",
                "values": [
                  {
                    "editorAlias": "Umbraco.MediaPicker3",
                    "culture": null,
                    "segment": null,
                    "alias": "image",
                    "value": [
                      {
                        "key": "d2e3f4a5-b6c7-4890-d1e2-f3a4b5c6d7e8",
                        "mediaKey": "499acc74-bac6-45ed-ace5-5d9a5b5370e0",
                        "mediaTypeAlias": "Image",
                        "crops": [],
                        "focalPoint": null
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "editorAlias": "Umbraco.TextBox",
                    "culture": null,
                    "segment": null,
                    "alias": "caption",
                    "value": "Network connections - representing MCP's ability to connect systems"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "contentTypeKey": "6aa38ff7-ac5a-46ca-842e-7a7d1a8fcc73",
                "key": "2f8efb4a-4eae-4166-9cd2-926081dbe9a0",
                "values": [
                  {
                    "editorAlias": "Umbraco.RichText",
                    "culture": null,
                    "segment": null,
                    "alias": "text",
                    "value": {
                      "markup": "<p>The real power of MCP comes from its extensibility. Anyone can create an MCP server that exposes their own tools and resources, and any MCP-compliant client can use them.</p><p>This creates a vibrant ecosystem where tools can be shared, reused, and combined in novel ways.</p>",
                      "blocks": {
                        "layout": {},
                        "contentData": [],
                        "settingsData": [],
                        "expose": []
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "contentTypeKey": "37e255e5-411b-499e-9299-6b2e354be1f0",
                "key": "ee726006-f305-4fa2-b49f-b0759e9ba4d1",
                "values": [
                  {
                    "editorAlias": "Umbraco.TextArea",
                    "culture": null,
                    "segment": null,
                    "alias": "quote",
                    "value": "The future of AI is interconnected, and MCP is the bridge."
                  },
                  {
                    "editorAlias": "Umbraco.TextBox",
                    "culture": null,
                    "segment": null,
                    "alias": "attribution",
                    "value": "Tech Visionary"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "settingsData": [],
            "expose": [
              {
                "contentKey": "ab65a8d9-1817-42a9-811a-3c74df605940",
